cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Research Radar, please cite it as below, and please also credit RTanalysis, which it is built on."
type: software
title: "Research Radar"
abstract: "Maps a research field from conference papers: clusters papers into topics, measures trends, finds gaps, and checks research ideas against the published literature."
authors:
